.TH P4KX-GUI 1 "" "P4KX" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
p4kx-gui \- desktop browser for Star Citizen Archives
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B p4kx-gui
.RI [ ARCHIVE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
P4KX browses local Archives, previews Entries and exports readable files.
Open an Archive from the Archive menu or drag a Data.p4k file onto the window.
The application includes model, texture, animation and audio previews.
It contains no game files or Archive key.
.SH FILES
Settings and the stored Archive key are in the P4KX directory below
XDG_CONFIG_HOME, or ~/.config when that variable is absent.
P4KX_FOLDERS_ROOT selects an absolute isolated root for config, cache and data.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR p4kx (1),
.BR p4kx-mcp (1)
.PP
